# No motion wrappers

This project does NOT use svelte-motion, Framer Motion, or `motion.div` / `motion.section` etc.

- Use plain HTML elements (`div`, `section`, `main`, etc.)
- For animation: use Svelte built-in transitions (`transition:`, `in:`, `out:`, `animate:`) or CSS
- NEVER add `motion.*` wrapper elements
- NEVER install svelte-motion or similar libs without explicit user request
